
    What is Virtual DOM ??

    Virtual DOM is a lightweight copy of the actual DOM.
    React uses it to improve performance by updating only the changed parts of the real DOM.



    How it works:

    State Change    ->      Virtual DOM     ->      Diffing (Compare)       ->      Update real DOM
 .                                                        🔽 
 .                                                 Only changed parts
 .                                                    are updated    